# Root lockfile stays local (the root is a pnpm consumer), but a bare
# `package-lock.json` here suppressed EVERY level - which silently blocked
# nexus-stage's lockfile from being committed and broke fresh-checkout
# `npm ci` (verify:nexus) with EUSAGE. Anchor to the root only.
/package-lock.json
